@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Azure Monitor and Insights";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="lead text-center">Learn how Azure Monitor and Insights provide end-to-end observability, ensuring reliability and performance in cloud applications.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">What is Azure Monitor?</h2>
        <p>
            Azure Monitor is a comprehensive monitoring service in Microsoft Azure that collects, analyzes, and acts on telemetry data from cloud and on-premises environments. It helps optimize performance, maintain availability, and detect operational issues before they affect users.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-monitor-overview.jpg" alt="Azure Monitor Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Monitor provides full-stack observability.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Key Features -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Key Features of Azure Monitor</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Data Collection:</strong> Gathers logs, metrics, and traces from applications, infrastructure, and networks.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Analytics & Insights:</strong> Uses AI-driven insights to detect anomalies and trends.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Alerts & Notifications:</strong> Provides real-time alerts for critical issues.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Integration:</strong> Seamlessly connects with Azure services, third-party tools, and dashboards.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Security & Compliance:</strong> Monitors security compliance and detects vulnerabilities.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/monitor-features.jpg" alt="Azure Monitor Features" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Monitor offers extensive capabilities for system health monitoring.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Azure Insights Overview -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">What are Azure Insights?</h2>
        <p>
            Azure Insights is a collection of services within Azure Monitor designed to offer deep insights into specific Azure workloads. These include Application Insights, Container Insights, VM Insights, and more.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Application Insights:</strong> Monitors application performance and usage.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Container Insights:</strong> Observes and diagnoses containerized applications.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>VM Insights:</strong> Provides deep performance monitoring for virtual machines.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Network Insights:</strong> Tracks and optimizes network performance.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-insights.jpg" alt="Azure Insights Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Insights help in targeted performance monitoring.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Setting Up Azure Monitor -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">How to Set Up Azure Monitor</h2>
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
            <li class="list-group-item">Go to the Azure Portal and search for "Azure Monitor".</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Select the resources you want to monitor.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Configure metrics and logs for data collection.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Set up alerts and notifications.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Use dashboards to visualize real-time monitoring data.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/setting-up-monitor.jpg" alt="Setting Up Azure Monitor" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Steps to configure Azure Monitor for effective monitoring.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Best Practices -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-secondary">Best Practices for Azure Monitor</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Enable Log Analytics:</strong> Use Log Analytics for deeper analysis of telemetry data.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Use Custom Alerts:</strong> Configure alerts tailored to your specific business needs.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Automate Incident Response:</strong> Set up automated responses for critical alerts.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Regularly Review Metrics:</strong> Continuously optimize performance based on real-time data.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Integrate with DevOps:</strong> Link monitoring with CI/CD pipelines for proactive troubleshooting.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/best-practices-monitoring.jpg" alt="Best Practices for Azure Monitor" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Following best practices ensures optimal monitoring.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-dark">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Azure Monitor and Insights provide comprehensive monitoring capabilities that enhance performance, security, and troubleshooting across cloud and hybrid environments. By leveraging these tools, organizations can ensure reliability and efficiency in their applications.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/conclusion-monitoring.jpg" alt="Azure Monitor Conclusion" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Monitor is essential for cloud-native observability.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
